Ok, source diving shows you are right. The actual sequence was:

The Aleax is slowing down.
The Aleax eats a lizard corpse.
The Aleax seems steadier now.

All 3 of these messages are generated by the single action of eating the 
lizard corpse: the first one as intrinsic speed is removed, then the 
eating, then the last one as the effect of the lizard corpse is to 
unconfuse the Aleax.


